{"id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-kripke-model.md","title":"Kripke Model","display":"df-kripke-model — Kripke Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-kripke-model","aliases":["89-df-kripke-model"],"display":"df-kripke-model — Kripke Model","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-kripke-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-kripke-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kripke-model — Kripke Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-kripke-model-—-Kripke-Model-$\\mathcal{M}$\">df-kripke-model — Kripke Model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal{P}(W)\">\\(V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal{P}(W)\\)</span> (valuation function, see\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KModel}(W,R,V)\">\\(\\mathrm{KModel}(W,R,V)\\)</span> 是下述定义的三元模型数据谓词，参数依次为世界集、可及关系与赋值函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KModel}(W,R,V)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\land V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal{M}_{W,R,V}\\coloneqq(W,R,V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KModel}(W,R,V)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\land V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal{M}_{W,R,V}\\coloneqq(W,R,V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}_{W,R,V}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}_{W,R,V}\\)</span> : 由满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KModel}(W,R,V)\">\\(\\mathrm{KModel}(W,R,V)\\)</span> 的数据组成的\nKripke 模型</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> : 赋值函数，将命题变元映射到使其为真的世界集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}(W)\">\\(\\mathcal{P}(W)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>的幂集</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-kripke-model-—-Kripke-Model-$\\mathcal{M}$","text":"df-kripke-model — Kripke Model $\\mathcal{M}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","tar